	(text_box "5V RAIL RIPPLE: ~9 mV pk-pk\nRC CORNER: f_c = 1/(2π*10Ω*10UF) ≈ 1.6 kHz\nAT 400 kHz THIS IS ROUGHLY 250x ABOVE CORNER, \nFOR FIRST-ORDER FALL-OFF OF 20 dB/DECADE GIVES\n48 dB ATTENUTATION.\n\n4-9 mV IN => 15-40 uV pk-pk ON +5VA\n\nMOSTLY CANCELED BY RATIOMETRIC LOAD CELL, REST IS\nREJECTED BY ADC. AT 400 kHz AND 256 kHz MODULATOR\nALIASES TO AROUND 112-144 kHz, FAR ABOVE DATA RATE\nAND FILTERED BY SINC. \n\nONLY 15TH HARMONIC (6.4 MHz) IS INTEGER MULTIPLE (25x) \nOF MODULATOR FREQ."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.36 20.32 0)
		(size 64.77 32.5731)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "41ee7dcc-a9de-458e-8a4b-018cc085a710")
	)
	(text_box "Rs = @{${Rs}/1000} kΩ 0.1%\nCdiff = @{${Cdiff}*10^9} nF\nCcm = @{${Ccm}*10^9} nF, C0G, 1-2%\n\nDIFF. CORNER = 1/(2π*2Rs*Cdiff) = @{round(1/(2*${PI}*2*${Rs}*${Cdiff}),0)} Hz\nCM CORNER = @{round(1/(2*${PI}*${Rs}*${Ccm})/1000,1)} kHz (~20x DIFF. CORNER)\n\nDESIGNED TO HANDLE ANTI-ALIASING AROUND\nADS1220 MODULATOR FREQ AND BLOCK RF FROM\nCABLE. THE DIFF. CORNER GIVES ~50 dB ATTEN.\n@ 256 kHz MODULATOR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.32 22.5323 0)
		(size 30.48 34.6177)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
